meta {
  name: Voice sessions
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  # Voice sessions

  Run the requests in order. `00-login` stores `ACCESS_TOKEN`; the settings
  request reads a VoiceAgent flow version; the session request creates the
  conversation and LiveKit room and stores the join details as collection
  variables.

  Set these collection or environment variables before running:

  - `VOICE_FLOW_VERSION_ID`: a VoiceAgent flow version UUID.
  - `VOICE_MODE`: `test` for the draft or `live` for a published version
    (default `test` in the request).

  Join the returned room with the LiveKit console or CLI using
  `VOICE_SERVER_URL`, `VOICE_CLIENT_TOKEN`, and `VOICE_ROOM_NAME`. The token is
  a short-lived credential; do not commit it or copy it into shared notes.
}
